This game is fantastic, it may be old but it's graphics are very good.
The time you can spend playing this game is almost infinite, and if you play with darthmod or if your pc is not so good, empire total factions, these mods make the game's life time even better and bigger, becuase you can them choose:
any nation that you want;
play a late or early campaign or as an emergent faction;
make 40 units campaing (I really recomend this if you have a good pc, you won't regret)
and you can have more units to choose from;
The game it self on vanilla is good, but you can only play with the main factions/great nations.
The multiplayer is kinda poor, you can only make naval, land and fort battles, you can choose a lot of maps and play up to 8 people in the same battle (4 VS 4) it is epic to watch, the bad part is the lag you will get because total war servers aren't very good and because of too much units against each other.
After all, great game, I recommend it a lot.
9/10

